    {t:'seq',d:H,q:'Arrange the Z scheme in the correct order of electron flow:',steps:['A. Cytochrome (electron transport) chain','B. P700 and its acceptor','C. Water and P680','D. NADP reductase and NADP<sup>+</sup>'],o:['C-A-B-D','A-C-B-D','C-B-A-D','B-A-C-D'],e:'Water/P680 &rarr; ETS &rarr; P700 &rarr; NADP<sup>+</sup>.'}
